<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" description="What information DealsSite collects, how it is used, and your choices.">
  <p>This policy explains what happens to your information when you use DealsSite. We do not offer user accounts and we do not ask you to submit personal details to browse the site.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Browsing data:</strong> standard server and analytics data such as pages visited, approximate location, browser type and referring page.</li>
    <li><strong>Preferences stored on your device:</strong> your light or dark mode choice, selected country, sidebar state and the time you last opened notifications. These stay in your browser's local storage and are not sent to us.</li>
    <li><strong>Email alert sign-ups:</strong> your name, email address and chosen brand, if you subscribe.</li>
    <li><strong>Messages:</strong> if you email us, we keep the message and your address to reply.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Email alerts</h2>
  <p>If you ask for email alerts about a brand, we collect your name, email address and the brand you chose. We use them only to send those alerts and keep them until you unsubscribe. You can ask us to remove your details at any time through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

  <h2>How we detect your country</h2>
  <p>The site reads your browser's time zone and language settings to guess your country so it can show relevant offers. This happens in your browser. You can change the country at any time from the country menu in the header.</p>

  <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
  <p>We use Google AdSense and similar partners to show ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies lets it and its partners serve ads based on your visit to our site and other sites on the internet.</p>
  <p>You can opt out of personalised advertising in <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a> or at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>. See our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> for more.</p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you click a link to a brand, the brand or an affiliate network may set cookies to credit the visit. See the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with service providers that help us run the site, such as hosting, analytics and advertising partners, and where required by law.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal data we hold about you, or to object to certain processing. Contact us using the details on the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
</LegalPage>
